NAME
       chown - change file owner and group

SYNOPSIS
       chown <user[:group]> <file>...

DESCRIPTION
       Changes the owner, and optionally the group, of each FILE. USER
       and GROUP may be given by name or by numeric id. Only root may
       give a file away.

EXAMPLES
       chown alice report.txt
       chown alice:staff /mnt/projects

SEE ALSO
       chmod(1), id(1), useradd(1)
